  journalEntry: "A deep violet mushroom with a glossy, almost wet-looking cap. Faint
    veins pulse beneath its surface, giving it an unsettling sense of life.\n\nIt
    releases a slow-acting toxin when disturbed. When brewed, its essence can turn
    a mixture harmful, though some alchemists find\u2026 creative uses for that."
